- **结构类**：Structure_DailySupport, Structure_WeeklyResistance, Structure_Breakout_4H, etc.
- **动量类**：RSI_Overbought_1H, RSI_Oversold_4H, MACD_Bullish_Daily, Momentum_Extreme_Hourly, etc.
